--- !u!114 &1744966482
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1744966479}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 708705254, guid: f70555f144d8491a825f0804e09c671c, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_FontData:
    m_Font: {fileID: 10102, guid: 0000000000000000e000000000000000, type: 0}
    m_FontSize: 50
    m_FontStyle: 0
    m_BestFit: 0
    m_MinSize: 5
    m_MaxSize: 50
    m_Alignment: 0
    m_AlignByGeometry: 0
    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "We both know that Facebook changed its name to meta recently, but meta
    in meta game has different meaning.But there are barriers between developer, avator
    and player, and we call the barrier \u2018the forth wall\u2019. And Meta game
    is like a game that break the forth wall, try to connect two or three of them
    together.ddlc: At the end of this game, the character Monika will talk to the
    player. She can even tell you what\u2019s the model of your computer, which really
    amazing me.pathologic: The first two characters you meet will directly tell player
    the rules of the game, which is somewhat strange in a game with a main storyline.
    But you will gradually find out the reason why they appear.tbg: It is totally
    a developer who tell his friend\u2019s progress about video game development.
    This is my favorite game. I can even say that it has changed my life.there is
    no game: the whole game is a trick that the developer wants to play with you.tsp:
    The narrator in this game represent the creator, and Stanley is the character.
    But maybe Stanley doesn\u2019t want to follow its creator.one shot: you, the player,
    will work together with the developer to help character neko come back home.\u968F\u7740\u6E38\u620F\u7684\u53D1\u5C55\uFF0Cmeta
    game\u7684\u6A21\u5F0F\u4E0E\u60C5\u8282\u4ECE\u6700\u65E9\u7684\u65B0\u9896\u521B\u610F\u8D8A\u53D1\u53D8\u4E3A\u4E00\u79CD\u5E38\u6001\uFF0C\u8BB8\u591A\u4E0D\u662Fmeta
    game\u7684\u6E38\u620F\u4E5F\u4F1A\u5728\u5176\u4E2D\u63D2\u5165\u4E00\u4E9B\u6253\u7834\u7B2C\u56DB\u9762\u5899\u7684\u60C5\u8282\uFF0C\u5BFC\u81F4\u8FD9\u6837\u7684\u5267\u60C5\u6A21\u5F0F\u4E5F\u9010\u6E10\u53D8\u5F97\u65E0\u8DA3\u4E86\u3002\u5176\u5B9E\u6211\u4EEC\u90FD\u77E5\u9053\uFF0C\u518D\u6240\u8C13\u201C\u6253\u7834\u7B2C\u56DB\u9762\u5899\u201D\u5176\u5B9E\u4E5F\u4E0D\u8FC7\u662F\u88AB\u7F16\u8F91\u597D\u7684\u5267\u60C5\u4E0E\u4EE3\u7801\uFF0C\u695A\u95E8\u8D70\u51FA\u4E86\u4ED6\u539F\u672C\u7684\u6444\u5F71\u68DA\uFF0C\u5374\u65E0\u6CD5\u8D70\u51FA\u7535\u5F71\u9662\u7684\u94F6\u5E55\uFF0C\u7B2C\u56DB\u9762\u5899\u662F\u6C38\u8FDC\u4E0D\u4F1A\u88AB\u771F\u6B63\u6253\u7834\u7684\u3002\u7136\u800C\uFF0C\u6211\u8BA4\u4E3Ameta
    game\u66F4\u591A\u5C55\u793A\u7684\u662F\u5BF9\u5F00\u53D1\u8005\u3001\u89D2\u8272\u3001\u73A9\u5BB6\u4E09\u8005\u5173\u7CFB\u7684\u63A2\u8BA8\u3002\u5F53Coda\u544A\u8BC9Davey\u201CDon\u2019t
    say anything\u201D\uFF0C\u5F53\u4F60\u900F\u8FC7\u5B66\u8005\u7684\u8EAB\u4EFD\u4EE5\u73A9\u5BB6\u672C\u8EAB\u7AD9\u5728\u821E\u53F0\u4E0A\u8BF4\u51FA\u201CHis
    words shall be my words. His deeds shall be my deeds\u201D\uFF0C\u6E38\u620F\u5728\u6B64\u523B\u63A2\u8BA8\u7684\u6B63\u662F\u6E38\u620F\u672C\u8EAB\u3002\u7B2C\u56DB\u9762\u5899\u80FD\u4E0D\u80FD\u88AB\u6253\u7834\uFF0C\u91CD\u8981\u5417\uFF1F\u6211\u4EEC\u867D\u8EAB\u5904\u5DE8\u5927\u7684\u821E\u53F0\u4E4B\u4E0A\uFF0C\u5374\u80FD\u4EE5\u601D\u7EF4\u8DF3\u51FA\u821E\u53F0\u4E4B\u5916\uFF0C\u56DE\u8FC7\u5934\u5BA1\u89C6\u81EA\u8EAB\u610F\u4E49\uFF0C\u8FD9\u4FBF\u662F\u6700\u597D\u7684meta\u3002As
    games evolve, the format and plots of meta games, once novel and innovative, have
    increasingly become a norm. Many games that are not meta games have also incorporated
    elements that break the fourth wall, rendering this narrative mode increasingly
    mundane. In reality, we all know that what is deemed as \"breaking the fourth
    wall\" is ultimately just a scripted plot and code. Just as Truman Burbank walked
    out of his original studio set but couldn't escape the movie screen, the fourth
    wall can never be truly broken. However, I believe that meta games are more about
    exploring the relationship between developers, characters, and players. When Coda
    tells Davey \"Don't say anything,\" and when you step onto the stage as the player
    and declare \"His words shall be my words. His deeds shall be my deeds,\" game,
    at that moment, is examining game itself. Does it really matter if the fourth
    wall can be broken? Even though we are on this vast stage, we can still use our
    minds to step outside it and reflect on our own significance. This, is the essence
    of \u2018meta\u2019."
--- !u!222 &1744966483
